&gt; On behalf of the :sparkles: Constellation Research Program Team :sparkles:, I'd like to invite you to apply to the next cohort of the *Anthropic AI Safety &amp; Security Fellows Program*.
&gt; 
&gt; Anthropic provides funding, compute, and direct mentorship to work full-time on AI safety and security research for four months.
&gt; 
&gt; Over 80% of fellows in the first cohorts produced papers, &gt;35% joined Anthropic full-time to work on AI safety research, and we supported many others to do great work at other AI safety orgs.
&gt; 
&gt; You can learn more about it here :arrow_right: <https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/anthropic/jobs/5183044008|Anthropic Fellows Program>
&gt; 
&gt; And then use this link to apply :arrow_right: <https://airtable.com/appceerp9YQRlwDhU/pagW63dilE5oV7cPY/form|Anthropic AI Safety &amp; Security Fellows Program>
&gt; 
&gt; We will accept applications until *Nov. 2, 2026*. The fellowship will start on *Jan. 18, 2027*.

